  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The positive charge $Q$ is situated at the centre of a cube\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_phy_a8.png\">\r\nAccording to Gauss theorem, the flux from any closed surface\r\n$$\r\n\\phi_{E}=\\frac{Q}{\\varepsilon_{0}}\r\n$$\r\nCube has 6 faces, so electric flux from any face $\\phi_{z}=\\frac{Q}{6 \\varepsilon_{0}}$",
    "image": null
  },
